><span begin="00:56.394" end="00:56.922">stand </span><span begin="00:56.922" end="00:57.275">there </span><span begin="00:57.275" end="00:57.466">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.658" end="00:59.850"><span begin="00:57.658" end="00:57.970">I </span><span begin="00:57.970" end="00:58.466">can't </span><span begin="00:58.466" end="00:58.810">tell </span><span begin="00:58.810" end="00:59.274">you </span><span begin="00:59.274" end="00:59.850">apart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.066" end="01:04.090"><span begin="01:00.066" end="01:00.258">I'll </span><span begin="01:00.258" end="01:00.506">be </span><span begin="01:00.506" end="01:00.842">rain </span><span begin="01:01.138" end="01:01.354">for </span><span begin="01:01.354" end="01:02.186">you </span><span begin="01:02.186" end="01:02.850">even </span><span begin="01:02.850" end="01:03.090">on </span><span begin="01:03.090" end="01:03.578">sunny </span><span begin="01:03.578" end="01:04.090">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.426" end="01:08.530"><span begin="01:04.426" end="01:04.786">So </span><span begin="01:04.786" end="01:05.130">paint </span><span begin="01:05.306" end="01:05.514">my </span><span begin="01:05.514" end="01:06.122">world </span><span begin="01:06.330" end="01:06.578">with </span><span begin="01:06.578" end="01:06.866">your </span><span begin="01:06.866" end="01:08.530">colors</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.158" end="01:28.126"><span begin="01:27.158" end="01:27.326">Let's </span><span begin="01:27.326" end="01:27.526">lie </span><span begin="01:27.526" end="01:27.726">in </span><span begin="01:27.726" end="01:27.926">the </span><span begin="01:27.926" end="01:28.126">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.022" end="01:31.254"><span begin="01:29.022" end="01:29.262">For </span><span begin="01:29.262" end="01:29.742">hours </span><span begin="01:29.742" end="01:30.046">and </span><span begin="01:30.046" end="01:31.254">hours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v